WEBVTT

00:00:00.279 --> 00:00:01.899
<v><b>Jemma:</b></v> I arrive on time.

00:00:02.186 --> 00:00:05.958
I’m hoping to have an interesting fun time with someone new.

00:00:06.504 --> 00:00:07.865
I see Pietro.

00:00:08.458 --> 00:00:10.508
My first impressions are good.

00:00:10.561 --> 00:00:12.884
He’s well-dressed and polite.

00:00:13.542 --> 00:00:21.170
We talk about all kinds of things: our travels, food, animals, places we’ve lived in, TV shows.

00:00:21.612 --> 00:00:26.103
He’s really interesting and funny, and I really enjoy talking to him.

00:00:26.793 --> 00:00:33.122
The only problem is, we are talking so much that I don’t notice that my shirt is on fire

00:00:33.258 --> 00:00:34.965
– from the candle on the table!

00:00:35.502 --> 00:00:38.250
The waiters run to the table to put it out!

00:00:39.104 --> 00:00:43.003
I’m not sure what he thinks of me – probably that I’m very talkative!

00:00:43.497 --> 00:00:47.974
We don’t have time to go anywhere after dinner, because I need to catch a train home,

00:00:47.975 --> 00:00:50.762
but I feel that we need more time together.

00:00:51.365 --> 00:00:55.019
We don’t kiss goodbye, but when I’m waiting for my train,

00:00:55.048 --> 00:00:58.942
he runs up and gives me a cake from the restaurant to eat on the train!

00:00:59.574 --> 00:01:03.081
Perhaps we can meet again and continue our conversation.

00:01:05.138 --> 00:01:08.175
<v><b>Pietro:</b></v> I arrive hoping to meet someone interesting.

00:01:08.696 --> 00:01:14.728
My first impressions are that she’s friendly and talkative, perhaps a bit nervous.

00:01:15.204 --> 00:01:16.854
But it’s very easy to chat.

00:01:17.336 --> 00:01:22.648
We talk about climate change, travel, TV shows, future plans.

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:24.767
She has good manners,

00:01:24.768 --> 00:01:29.561
and she politely asks the waiter if we can move to a quieter table.

00:01:30.226 --> 00:01:35.927
I think she loves life, and is very adventurous, and has had a lot of experiences.

00:01:36.590 --> 00:01:40.836
I’m not sure what she thinks of me, maybe that I’m a bit young,

00:01:41.283 --> 00:01:43.983
but I hope she thinks I’m interesting.

00:01:44.559 --> 00:01:48.037
I’m sad that we can’t go somewhere for a drink after dinner,

00:01:48.361 --> 00:01:50.580
but she needs to get her train home.

00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:53.157
It’s an unforgettable evening.

00:01:53.528 --> 00:01:59.700
In fact, truly unforgettable, because during the dinner her shirt catches fire!

00:02:01.036 --> 00:02:02.930
I’d really like to meet again.